message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ESP32-simple_mqtt_lora: a simple LoRa to MQTT gateway"
abstract: "An ESP32 program that receives LoRa messages and publishes them to an MQTT broker over Wi-Fi. Written in C with ESP-IDF and FreeRTOS, in VS Code with PlatformIO, at the Universidade de Brasília with Prof. Jones Yudi Mori Alves da Silva."
